    "description": "Mine (stage 3, gems), level 3 of 3: L2 plus flourish 3. Over budget: 841 blocks vs 170 (it holds stages 1 and 2 too). Stage 3 of the mine (gems, tier 7): all of mine 2 (adit, headframe, sorting shed, gold lockup) plus a timber-and-plaster winch house that hauls the hoist rope from the headframe. L2 adds a gem cutter's bench under a pent roof along its front; L3 a yard of raw crystal (amethyst) behind it, barrels of cut gems, purple banners, flower boxes and a sign. Not yet builder-tested: allium, amethyst_block, amethyst_cluster, calcite, cauldron, chiseled_stone_bricks, coal_block, cornflower, dandelion, fern, iron_bars, iron_door, ladder, medium_amethyst_bud, moss_carpet, purple_wall_banner, rail, raw_iron_block, red_banner, red_wall_banner, stone_brick_slab, stonecutter, yellow_banner, yellow_wall_banner. Decoration step adds: item, item_frame, minecart, sign_text.",
